  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b24d8aca18bfa5e498469209dad926f7, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level-3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Phrases
  levelBoxPhrases:
  - Get a degree, and your future is guaranteed.
  - Education opens every door
  - Your diploma will make you valuable.
  - There will always be work for qualified people.
  - "Follow the path, and you\u2019ll find your place."
  - "Good grades lead to a good life.\u201D"
  - Your effort will eventually be rewarded
  - The world needs people like you
  - Talent always finds an opportunity.
  - Your dream job is waiting for you.
  - This is the beginning of your new life.
  - This is the beginning of your new life.
  levelDeadPhrases:
  - Nothing was ever guaranteed.
  - Only for those already holding the key
  - They only asked how much you would cost.
  - Qualified was never the same as wanted.
  - The path was built to keep you walking
  - You passed every test except theirs.
  - Eventually was never a real date.
  - It just never planned to pay them.
  - Opportunity was looking for connections.
  - It was waiting for someone with experience
  - It was only the end of your old hope
  - It was only the end of your old hope
  levelGoalPhrase: YOU EARNED IT. WORTH EVERY DEATH?
